OL,3,GNEWSADeputy says rental prices are
OL,4,Astabilising
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president of Guernsey's housing
OL,7,Fcommittee said there has been "some
OL,8,Fstabilisation" in the rental market on
OL,9,Fthe island.
OL,11,FDeputy Steve Williams said it was
OL,12,Freassuring to see rent increases level
OL,13,Fout and it needed to continue to ensure
OL,14,Frenting stays affordable for islanders.
OL,16,FThe former Guernsey Housing Association
OL,17,FCEO said it was possible the demand for
OL,18,Frentals could have dropped because
OL,19,Fthere had not been a "massive increase"
OL,20,Fin the supply.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
