OL,3,GNEWSADeputy says rental prices are
OL,4,Astabilising
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "There's a lot of variables
OL,7,Finvolved in the housing market in terms
OL,8,Fof peoples' income levels, people
OL,9,Fcoming and going."
